# case_flip.ds - Echo input with the case of letters flipped.
# Demonstrates LISTEN (input), looping until EOF, and range-checking
# arithmetic. For each input character:
#   - If it is uppercase A-Z (ASCII 65-90), add 32 -> lowercase.
#   - If it is lowercase a-z (ASCII 97-122), subtract 32 -> uppercase.
#   - Otherwise pass through unchanged.
# Stops when LISTEN returns 0 (EOF).
#
# Tape layout used here:
#   c0 : current character
#   c2 : is_upper flag      (set by inline range_check macro)
#   c3 : is_lower flag      (set by inline range_check macro)
#   c4..c7 : scratch cells used by range_check
#
# Range check pattern: copy source to a temp, subtract the lower bound,
# then run a coupled countdown of (temp, counter) initialised to
# (source-lower, upper-lower+1). If the counter has anything left when
# temp hits zero, the source was in [lower, upper].
#
# Run it like:
#   python3 drivescript_interpreter.py case_flip.ds --input "Hello, World!"
# Output:
#   hELLO, wORLD!

# === Main loop: Read input and process until EOF (char == 0) ===
PARK
  LISTEN
  PARK  # Only execute body if char != 0 (not EOF)

    # === Setup: Copy c0 to c4 (temp for range checking) ===
    PARK BRAKE GEAR 4 RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT DRIVE
    GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT PARK BRAKE GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT GAS GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT DRIVE 

    # === Range check for UPPERCASE (65-90) ===
    GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 4 LEFT
    GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GAS 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT 
    PARK GEAR 4 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT PARK BRAKE RIGHT GAS RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 LEFT DRIVE 
    GEAR 2 RIGHT PARK BRAKE GEAR 2 LEFT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT DRIVE 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT 
    GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE RIGHT BRAKE LEFT DRIVE 

    # === If uppercase: add 32 to convert to lowercase ===
    GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 2 RIGHT 
    PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 3 LEFT PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 3 RIGHT DRIVE 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT BRAKE GEAR 4 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT DRIVE GEAR 4 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT 
    PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 3 LEFT GAS GEAR 3 RIGHT DRIVE 

    # === Range check for LOWERCASE (97-122) ===
    GEAR 5 LEFT 
    PARK BRAKE GEAR 4 RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT DRIVE 
    GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT PARK BRAKE GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT GAS GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT DRIVE 
    GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 2 BRAKE 
    GEAR 4 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GAS 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT 
    PARK GEAR 4 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT PARK BRAKE RIGHT GAS RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 LEFT DRIVE 
    GEAR 2 RIGHT PARK BRAKE GEAR 2 LEFT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT DRIVE 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT 
    GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE RIGHT BRAKE LEFT DRIVE 

    # === If lowercase: subtract 32 to convert to uppercase ===
    GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 2 RIGHT 
    PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 3 LEFT PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 3 RIGHT DRIVE 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT BRAKE GEAR 4 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 4 RIGHT DRIVE GEAR 4 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT 
    PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 2 LEFT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT DRIVE 

    # === Output the character (original or transformed) ===
    GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 RIGHT 
    PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 2 LEFT 
    GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 2 GAS 
    GEAR 2 RIGHT DRIVE 
    GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 3 RIGHT 
    PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 3 LEFT 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE 
    GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 2 BRAKE 
    GEAR 3 RIGHT DRIVE 
    GEAR 3 LEFT HONK 

  DRIVE
DRIVE